  /** ResourceName is the Kubernetes resource this allowance counts, such as nvidia.com/gpu or google.com/tpu. It becomes the resource entry in the materialized ClusterQueue's resourceGroup. Which names are budgetable is operator config; the API accepts any qualified resource name. */
