  /** Capacity is the observed accelerator capacity behind this tree, reported on the root node only. On a management plane it is the fleet view broken down per cluster; on a workload cluster it is that cluster's own derived capacity, which is the only thing the local controller writes on its root. */
  capacity?: AcceleratorCapacityStatus[]
