/** AnalysisMetric is one success condition: a PromQL query whose scalar result is compared against Threshold with Operator. A multi-series result is reduced to the worst series for the operator before comparison — the maximum for LT/LTE, the minimum for GT/GTE — so the metric passes only when every series passes. */
