/** EndpointOverrideSpec configures Envoy Gateway's loadBalancer endpoint-override feature. When a request carries an endpoint reference (typically a header), the gateway routes the request to that exact endpoint if healthy, otherwise falls back to the configured LoadBalancer Algorithm. */
